# 25. Definition of Done

Phase 1 is complete when the following works:

```text
                 Browser
                    │
                    ▼
                adk web
                    │
                    ▼
          self_improving_agent
                    │
                    ▼
             Google ADK 2
                    │
                    ▼
                LiteLLM
                    │
                    ▼
        Docker Desktop / Llama 3.2
                    │
                    ▼
                 Response
```

A developer can run:

```bash
adk web
```

select the agent, send a question, and receive a response generated by the local Docker-based Llama 3.2 model.

At this point, the basic agent foundation is proven.

